{"type":"message","id":"912b5d73","parentId":"d4c6b8f8","timestamp":"2026-05-21T11:54:54.988Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_crgc3JbKadAq1YnOulp5NzCc","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# TOOLS.md — Scribe's WordPress Environment\n\nThis file contains the exact credentials and paths for publishing to WordPress. The `publish.sh` skill script embeds these values — this file is your reference.\n\n---\n\n## WordPress Site\n\n| Key | Value |\n|---|---|\n| **Site URL** | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com` |\n| **API Base** | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com/wp-json/wp/v2` |\n| **Username** | `spearmintmarketingpro@gmail.com` |\n| **App Password** | `B1u0 7AQI Aw5a IQK7 0KWX PtGU` |\n| **Category ID** | `3` (Crypto News) |\n| **Post Status** | `publish` (live). Use `--status draft` on the script for review-first. |\n\n---\n\n## Article & Image (from pipeline run)\n\n| File | What it is |\n|---|---|\n| `/tmp/crypto-article.md` | The article written by the Writer agent |\n| `/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg` | The feature image generated by the Creator agent |\n\n---\n\n## Output Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| `/tmp/wp-result.txt` | WordPress post URL on success |\n| `/tmp/wp-error.log` | Exact error reason on failure |\n\n---\n\n## Skill Script\n\n```\n~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n```\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\nbash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh \\\n  --title \"Article Title Here\" \\\n  --excerpt \"First 1-2 sentences of the article.\"\n```\n\n- `--title` and `--excerpt` are optional — the script auto-extracts them from `/tmp/crypto-article.md` if not provided.\n- Exit `0` → success → read `/tmp/wp-result.txt` for the post URL\n- Exit `1` → failure → read `/tmp/wp-error.log` for the reason\n\n---\n\n## OpenClaw Workspace\n\n| Item | Path |\n|---|---|\n| **This workspace** | `~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/` |\n| **Agent sessions** | `~/.openclaw/agents/wp-publisher/sessions/` |\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779364494988}}
